<section class="hero"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span></span> LESS WASTE. MORE POSSIBILITY.</div><h1>A little extra.<br>A <em>lot of good.</em></h1><p>Turn the food you have to spare into a meal that matters. Connect with local orphanages and bring more people to the table.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="<?=url('register.php')?>">I want to share food <?=icon('arrow')?></a><a class="button outline" href="<?=url('donations.php')?>">Find a donation</a></div><div class="hero-foot"><?=icon('heart')?> Thoughtful sharing. Local connections. Real impact.</div></div><div class="hero-art"><img src="<?=url('assets/images/hero.svg')?>" alt="Illustrated bowl of vegetables, rice and fresh food"><div class="floating-note"><?=icon('leaf')?><div><b>Good food. Better together.</b><small>Make room for a little kindness.</small></div></div><span class="art-label">EVERY PLATE HAS A PURPOSE</span></div></section>
<section class="stats-strip"><?php foreach([['SELECT COUNT(*) FROM donations WHERE status="collected"','Donations collected'],['SELECT COALESCE(SUM(quantity),0) FROM donations WHERE status="collected"','Servings shared'],['SELECT COUNT(*) FROM users WHERE role="orphanage" AND status="approved"','Orphanages connected']] as [$sql,$label]):?><div><strong><?=number_format(query($sql)->fetchColumn())?></strong><span><?=e($label)?></span></div><?php endforeach;?><p>Small contributions.<br><b>Meaningful change.</b></p></section>
<section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">FRESH OPPORTUNITIES TO HELP</div><h2>Good food, ready to go.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="<?=url('donations.php')?>">Explore all donations <?=icon('arrow')?></a></div><?php cards(query("SELECT d.* FROM donations d JOIN users u ON u.id=d.donor_id WHERE d.status='pending' AND u.status='approved' ORDER BY d.created_at DESC LIMIT 3")->fetchAll());?></section>
<section class="how section"><div class="eyebrow">A SIMPLE WAY TO MAKE A DIFFERENCE</div><h2>From your kitchen.<br>To someone's table.</h2><div class="steps"><?php foreach([['01','Share what you can','Post food details, servings and a pickup window.'],['02','Make a connection','An approved orphanage accepts your donation.'],['03','Pass the goodness on','Arrange pickup and confirm the food was received.']] as [$n,$h,$p]):?><article><span><?=$n?></span><h3><?=$h?></h3><p><?=$p?></p></article><?php endforeach;?></div></section><section class="cta"><div><div class="eyebrow">THERE IS ROOM FOR EVERYONE</div><h2>Your next good deed<br>could be a meal.</h2></div><a class="button orange" href="<?=url('register.php')?>">Become part of MealBridge <?=icon('arrow')?></a></section><?php require 'includes/footer.php';?>